WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.174
[g@"Who are you?" the monster asked the monkey.

2
00:00:06.175 --> 00:00:08.914
"What are you doing here?"@g]

3
00:00:08.915 --> 00:00:14.606
"I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain," said the monkey.

4
00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:18.148
"I'm helping the Tang Monk reach the Western Paradise.

5
00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:22.217
Five hundred years ago, I caused a lot of trouble in Heaven.

6
00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:25.845
Now I'm here to cause a lot of trouble for you!"

7
00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:29.524
"I remember you," said the monster.

8
00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:34.000
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and swung it.

9
00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:41.034
[g@[i@Poof!@i] The monster vanished.

10
00:00:41.035 --> 00:00:44.785
Wukong leaped into the air.@g]

11
00:00:44.786 --> 00:00:49.393
He looked in every direction but didn't see the monster anywhere.

12
00:00:49.394 --> 00:00:54.732
"That monster said he remembered me," thought Wukong.

13
00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:57.069
"He must be from Heaven.

14
00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:02.140
I'll go up there now to see if any spirits are missing."

15
00:01:02.141 --> 00:01:07.185
Wukong soared higher and higher until he reached the southern gate of Heaven.

16
00:01:07.186 --> 00:01:10.339
"Greetings, Wukong," said the guard.

17
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.948
"There's a monster on Earth causing trouble for the Tang Monk," said Wukong.

18
00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:18.678
[g@"I think the monster is a spirit who escaped from Heaven.

19
00:01:18.679 --> 00:01:20.466
Is anyone missing?"@g]

20
00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:24.562
The guard sent a messenger to check.

21
00:01:24.563 --> 00:01:27.244
[g@A moment later the messenger returned.

22
00:01:27.245 --> 00:01:29.679
A god was with him.@g]

23
00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:35.250
"You found the Wood Wolf Star," said the god.

24
00:01:35.251 --> 00:01:37.669
"Who?" asked Wukong.

25
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:43.432
"The Wood Wolf Star is a wolf spirit who lives in Heaven," said the god.

26
00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:49.723
"He escaped 13 days ago, and I've been looking all over for him."

27
00:01:49.724 --> 00:01:52.099
[g@Wukong rubbed his chin.

28
00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.407
"That makes sense," he said.@g]

29
00:01:54.408 --> 00:01:58.203
"The monster kidnapped a princess 13 years ago on Earth.

30
00:01:58.204 --> 00:02:01.970
Thirteen years on Earth is equal to 13 days in Heaven."

31
00:02:01.971 --> 00:02:06.123
[g@The god nodded. "Yes. Let's go.

32
00:02:06.124 --> 00:02:11.089
I'll help you catch the Wood Wolf Star."@g]

33
00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:15.436
Wukong returned to Earth with the god.

34
00:02:15.437 --> 00:02:20.193
[g@From the sky the god called down, "Wood Wolf Star!

35
00:02:20.194 --> 00:02:23.006
Come up here at once!"@g]

36
00:02:23.007 --> 00:02:28.061
[g@Wukong saw a small splash in a river below.

37
00:02:28.062 --> 00:02:30.925
The monster leaped out.@g]

38
00:02:30.926 --> 00:02:36.208
The monster turned into a wolf and flew up to the god.

39
00:02:36.209 --> 00:02:38.710
The wolf looked nervous.

40
00:02:38.711 --> 00:02:42.792
"You will be punished!" said the god.

41
00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:46.346
He turned and led the wolf back up to Heaven.

42
00:02:46.347 --> 00:02:53.230
Wukong flew to the Precious Image Kingdom and went into the palace.

43
00:02:53.231 --> 00:02:56.418
A big celebration was taking place.

44
00:02:56.419 --> 00:03:02.364
The king and queen were both hugging their daughter, Princess Hundred Flowers.

45
00:03:02.365 --> 00:03:05.747
[g@The princess saw Wukong and smiled.

46
00:03:05.748 --> 00:03:09.645
"Father, Mother—this is Sun Wukong.@g]

47
00:03:09.646 --> 00:03:14.647
He's the monkey spirit who rescued Sha Wujing and me earlier."

48
00:03:14.648 --> 00:03:16.713
The king and queen bowed.

49
00:03:16.714 --> 00:03:19.961
"We can never thank you enough," said the queen.

50
00:03:19.962 --> 00:03:24.614
"You and your friends have made us very happy."

51
00:03:24.615 --> 00:03:28.551
"It was nothing at all," said Wukong with a laugh.

52
00:03:28.552 --> 00:03:33.486
"We save people from monsters and demons almost every day."

53
00:03:33.487 --> 00:03:35.648
[g@He looked around.

54
00:03:35.649 --> 00:03:37.838
"Where's the Tang Monk?"@g]

55
00:03:37.839 --> 00:03:39.959
The king looked at the ground.

56
00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.700
[g@"Didn't your friends tell you?

57
00:03:41.701 --> 00:03:44.442
He is really a tiger."@g]

58
00:03:44.443 --> 00:03:47.352
"Nonsense!" said Wukong.

59
00:03:47.353 --> 00:03:50.120
[g@"That monster turned him into a tiger, that's all.

60
00:03:50.121 --> 00:03:52.021
Where is he?"@g]

61
00:03:52.022 --> 00:03:56.842
The king and queen led Wukong out of the hall.

62
00:03:56.843 --> 00:04:01.145
They went down a flight of stairs and arrived at the palace dungeon.

63
00:04:01.146 --> 00:04:06.153
A large tiger sat in a cage.

64
00:04:06.154 --> 00:04:08.943
[g@"Don't worry, Master," said Wukong.

65
00:04:08.944 --> 00:04:11.712
"I'll change you back into yourself."@g]

66
00:04:11.713 --> 00:04:14.249
[g@Wukong recited a spell.

67
00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:19.069
Bright light surrounded the cage for a moment.@g]

68
00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.637
[g@The Tang Monk was back!

69
00:04:21.638 --> 00:04:26.566
Wukong grabbed the bars and twisted them apart.@g]

70
00:04:26.567 --> 00:04:29.377
"Thank you, Wukong," cried the monk.

71
00:04:29.378 --> 00:04:32.072
He took the monkey's hands in his own.

72
00:04:32.073 --> 00:04:34.675
"I never should have told you to leave.

73
00:04:34.676 --> 00:04:37.294
Will you continue the journey with us?"

74
00:04:37.295 --> 00:04:48.054
Wukong smiled. "We will reach the Western Paradise together."

